for the territory conquest.

4
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:21,604
The reason I say we push slow

5
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,606
is because if we charge full speed,
Min-jae would be out front alone.

6
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,067
But if we move slowly,
three side by side, we'd move as one.

7
00:00:26,151 --> 00:00:28,111
We stay tight and move as one.

8
00:00:28,194 --> 00:00:29,529
You guys push us from the back.

9
00:00:29,612 --> 00:00:32,615
Once we're up there,
we form up with our backs together…

10
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,659
I say we girls stand in the center

11
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:37,871
-with you guys around us.
-Circling you?

12
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:39,664
Because if they try yanking us out,
we're done for.

13
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:42,459
If we get lucky
and reach the territory first,

14
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:44,627
we'd huddle up, facing in,

15
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:47,130
arms locked,
so that if one link gets breached,

16
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:49,048
the ones on either side would hold on.

17
00:00:49,132 --> 00:00:51,718
This means an opponent
would have to pull the strength

18
00:00:51,801 --> 00:00:54,429
of two or three people combined
rather than just one.

19
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:56,222
We named this the "flower" strategy.

20
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:57,265
"Flower."

21
00:00:57,348 --> 00:00:58,308
This is the first game.

22
00:00:58,391 --> 00:01:00,143
Everyone's going to be
fired up with adrenaline.

23
00:01:00,226 --> 00:01:02,228
