-Right.

24
00:01:02,312 --> 00:01:04,397
So you wrestlers
have a huge edge in the territory.

25
00:01:04,481 --> 00:01:05,690
-Right.
-We come out swinging

26
00:01:05,774 --> 00:01:06,775
